      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Kujou Takayuki: Kujou Sara",
      "content": "Takayuki's adoptive daughter, a tengu general of the Tenryou Commission. He named her Sara after finding her unconscious with a Vision, trained her as an all-around warrior and expected her to secure the clan's future; she is loyal to the Shogun and considers him a benefactor, though she senses he does not see her as family. She learned of his betrayal from Yae Miko's evidence and confronted him, calling him a hypocrite.",
