      "comment": "Kujou Takayuki: Vision Hunt Decree and Fatui bargain",
      "content": "Before Chapter II, Snezhnayan diplomats promised Takayuki a generous reward if he saw the Vision Hunt Decree upheld. The Fatui sold Delusions and caused chaos; Takayuki wanted to preserve his clan's influence and crack down on rivals. He sent the Shogun reports claiming all was well and told Sara nothing.",
