      "key": [
        "Tenryou Commission Headquarters",
        "Proof of Guilt",
        "Blind Loyalty Reckless Courage"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Kujou Takayuki: Exposure at the Tenryou Commission Headquarters",
      "content": "Sara and the Traveler fought through guards to reach him. He confirmed everything, said the Fatui were being used by him, and answered Sara's charge of hypocrisy by claiming he was safeguarding the eternity of the Kujou Clan. He then told them the Shogun was at Tenshukaku receiving Signora.",
