      "comment": "Kujou Takayuki: Yashiori Island investigation",
      "content": "After Masahito's letter about the Tatarigami, Takayuki sent a Kujou samurai team. Their Lost Texts record illness, nightmares and unease, and a recalled instruction to sink refugees' boats and blame rebels. The entire team is presumed dead or missing.",
